{"id": "12th_tamil_u5_q832", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "deivamani_maalai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "jeevakaarunyam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘வாடிய பயிரைக் கண்டபோதெல்லாம் வாடினேன்’ என்று உருகி அனைத்து உயிர்களிடத்தும் கருணை காட்டிய வள்ளலாரின் கோட்பாடு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மாயாவாதம்", "B": "அகிம்சை தத்துவம் மட்டும்", "C": "பயன்பாட்டு வாதம்", "D": "ஜீவகாருண்ய ஒழுக்கம் (ஆன்மநேய ஒருமைப்பாடு)"}, "explanation": "மனிதர்கள் மட்டுமல்லாது தாவரங்கள், விலங்குகள் உள்ளிட்ட அனைத்து உயிர்களிடத்தும் அன்பு செலுத்துவதே ‘ஜீவகாருண்ய ஒழுக்கம்’ என வள்ளலார் அருளினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which cardinal doctrine of universal empathy was promulgated by Vallalar who proclaimed 'Whenever I beheld withered crops, my soul withered too'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mayavada", "B": "Passive non-violence alone", "C": "Utilitarianism", "D": "Jeevakaarunya Ozhukkam (Compassion towards all sentient living beings)"}, "explanation": "Vallalar formulated 'Jeevakaarunya Ozhukkam' as the supreme path to spiritual beatitude."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class