{"id": "12th_tamil_u5_q912", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "padimam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "image_definition_critic", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘படிமம் என்பது ஒரு கணத்தில் வெளிப்படும் அறிவு மற்றும் உணர்வு சார்ந்த ஒரு சிக்கலான மனநிலை’ என்று வரையறுத்த மேலைநாட்டுக் கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஷெல்லி", "B": "பைரன்", "C": "கீட்ஸ்", "D": "எஸ்ரா பவுண்ட் (Ezra Pound)"}, "explanation": "‘An image is that which presents an intellectual and emotional complex in an instant of time’ என்று எஸ்ரா பவுண்ட் படிமத்திற்கு இலக்கணம் வகுத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Anglo-American poet defined an image as 'that which presents an intellectual and emotional complex in an instant of time'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Percy Bysshe Shelley", "B": "Lord Byron", "C": "John Keats", "D": "Ezra Pound"}, "explanation": "Ezra Pound famously formulated this landmark definition of the poetic image."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 119, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 119", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 5", "Grammar", "Ezra Pound Definition"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u5_q913", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "padimam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "padimam_in_tamil_roots", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழில் ‘படிமம்’ என்னும் சொல்லை இலக்கியத் திறனாய்வுச் சொல்லாகப் பரவலாக்கிய முன்னோடித் திறனாய்வாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "க.நா. சுப்பிரமணியம் மற்றும் சி. சு. செல்லப்பா", "B": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "C": "திரு. வி. க.", "D": "உ.வே.சா."}, "explanation": "எழுத்து இதழ் காலகட்டத்தில் க.நா.சுப்பிரமணியம், சி.சு.செல்லப்பா முதலான திறனாய்வாளர்கள் 'படிமம்' என்ற கோட்பாட்டைத் தமிழில் ஆழமாக அறிமுகப்படுத்தினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which modern literary critics popularized 'Padimam' as a critical analytical term in Tamil modern poetry discussions?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ka. Naa. Subramanyam and C.S. Chellappa", "B": "Maraimalai Adigal", "C": "Thiru. Vi. Ka.", "D": "U.V. Swaminatha Iyer"}, "explanation": "Ka. Naa. Su and C.S. Chellappa championed the concept of Padimam through the literary journal Ezhuthu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "p